## Interface: 16001
## Title: Forever Quiver
## Notes: Hunter utilities for WoW: Forever: Auto Shot timer, castbar, range indicator, aspect and Trueshot reminders, Tranq announcer, ammo warning, spell menus on one key, beast ability tooltips and a Questie quest arrow.
